- PbS(s): 91.2 J/K mol
- O2(g): 205.1 J/K mol
- PbO(s): 66.5 J/K mol
- SO2(g): 248.2 J/K mol

Now, we can calculate the entropy change:

ΔS = (2 * S_PbO + 2 * S_SO2) - (2 * S_PbS + 3 * S_O2)

