   The moles of \( H_2SO_4 \) in \( x \) liters of the 6.00 M solution is:
   \[
   \text{Moles} = 6.00 \, \text{M} \times x \, \text{L} = 6.00x \, \text{moles}
   \]

5. **Total moles of \( H_2SO_04 \) in the final solution:**
