ΔH = -392 kJ/mol - 762 kJ/mol + 340 kJ/mol + 1379.4 kJ/mol

ΔH = (-392 - 762 + 340 + 1379.4) kJ/mol

ΔH = 565.4 kJ/mol

So, the standard enthalpy change for the reaction is 565.4 kJ/mol.",fluency,"# Task Description
