2. **Simplifying the Integral**:
   The integral becomes:
   \[
   \frac{1}{N_A} \frac{1}{h^3} \int \exp \left( -\frac{p_x^2}{2mkT} \right) dx \int \exp \left( -\frac{p_y^2}{2mkT} \right) dy \int \exp \left( -\frac{p_z^2}{2mkT} \right) dz
   \]
