\]

Now, calculate the time observed on Earth (\(\Delta t\)):
\[
\Delta t = \gamma \Delta t_0 = 1.25 \times 3 \text{ years} = 3.75 \text{ years}
\]
So, 3.75 years have eliminated on Earth while the cockpit clock counted 3 years.

