\]

At \(T = 300 \text{ K}\), \(n_i = 1.5 \times 10^{10} \text{ cm}^{-3}\):

\[
\phi_F = 0.0259 \ln\left(\frac{10^{16}}{1.5 \times 10^{10}}\right) \approx 0.36 \text{ V}
\]

